# Agent core (AgathaTrack)

## Start here

- **Domain map:** `docs/architecture/index.md` (read before broad search)
- **Cursor framework:** `docs/engineering/cursor-agent-framework.md` · Router: `.cursor/agent-kernel/ROUTER.md`
- **Efficiency plan:** `docs/agent-efficiency/plans/agent-efficiency-plan.md`
- **Sprint status:** `docs/debt/refactoring-log.md`
- **Institutional memory:** `.agents/memory/MEMORY.md`

## Tier 1 commands (normal use)

| Command | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| `/execute-plan` | Multi-phase autonomous plans — gate exit `0` = proceed without asking |
| `/babysit-plus` | Bounded autonomous work → PR triage, CI, merge |
| `/babysit-uat` | **Final** merge to `main` + pre-UAT E2E gate |
| `/e2e-debug` | Pre-UAT remedial fix loop (chains to babysit-uat) |
| `/ui-design-deep` | Flow/theme/multi-screen design + implementation |

Each Tier 1 skill runs the **Engineering Router** first (profile per skill), then loads only applicable **protocols** under `.cursor/agent-kernel/protocols/`.

## Definition of done

Complete when the requested outcome **and** Router-determined verification pass: tests, lint/pre-push, contracts, migrations, security checks, docs — as applicable. Not merely “looks working.” Details: Router + `docs/engineering/cursor-agent-framework.md`.

## PR hygiene

- **Pre-PR critical self-review** — `.cursor/rules/pr-hygiene.mdc`
- **Babysit model:** `composer-2.5` only for `/babysit`, `/babysit-plus`, `/babysit-uat`
- Policy: `docs/agent-efficiency/pr-review-cost-efficiency.md`

## Pre-push

| When | Command |
|------|---------|
| During iteration | `./scripts/pre-push-changed.sh` |
| Before merge to `main` | `./scripts/pre-push.sh` |

Skill: `/pre-push-verify`. Do not duplicate in chat — run the script.

## Internal / advanced (Tier 2)

`/spawn-sprint-agents` · `/pre-push-verify` · `/dependabot-batch` · `/split-flutter-screen` · `/add-bdd-playwright-scenario`

Orchestrators invoke these; not equivalent to Tier 1.

## Non-negotiables

- Hand-written files ≤ **500 lines** (`node scripts/check_file_size.js`)
- BDD gate: `node e2e/scripts/check_bdd_coverage.js --report-only`
- Node.js canonical backend; calendar dates `YYYY-MM-DD` on wire
- Never raw exception text in prod 5xx bodies
- **UAT WAF:** no CI IP whitelist — live E2E advisory; see `docs/e2e/uat-deploy-tiers.md`
- **Atomic PRs:** one verifiable outcome — `docs/agent-efficiency/atomic-pr-policy.md`

## Cloud environment

PostgreSQL: `sudo pg_ctlcluster 16 main start`  
Backend: `cd server && PGUSER=user PGPASSWORD=password PGHOST=localhost PGPORT=5432 PGDATABASE=agatha_db node bin/start.js`  
Full: `AGENTS.md`.

